{
  "question": "26년 9월 기준 활동회원에서 중단가능성이 높은 회원 중 캠페인카테고리(고려인캠페인)을 후원중인 회원 수와 회원번호 명단 상위 10명",
  "result": "The question is clear and I can answer it with the following SQL.\n\nGenerated SQL (ensure the -- Generated by Cortex Analyst comment is included when executing the SQL):\n```sql\nWITH __cc AS (\n  SELECT\n    active_spnsr_cnt,\n    cmpgn_ctgr_nm,\n    has_member_pred,\n    mber_no,\n    member_churn_grade,\n    sponsor_churn_grade,\n    stdr_mt,\n    member_churn_prob\n  FROM GN_DW.SERVING.ML_CHURN_BY_CMPGN_CTGR_V\n), base AS (\n  SELECT\n    __cc.mber_no,\n    __cc.member_churn_prob,\n    __cc.member_churn_grade,\n    __cc.sponsor_churn_grade,\n    __cc.active_spnsr_cnt,\n    __cc.has_member_pred\n  FROM __cc\n  WHERE\n    __cc.stdr_mt = '202609' AND __cc.cmpgn_ctgr_nm = '고려인캠페인'\n), denom AS (\n  SELECT\n    COUNT(DISTINCT mber_no) AS act,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN has_member_pred THEN mber_no END) AS pred,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN member_churn_grade = '고위험' THEN mber_no END) AS high\n  FROM base\n)\nSELECT\n  b.mber_no AS \"회원번호\",\n  ROUND(b.member_churn_prob * 100, 2) AS \"회원 중단확률(%)\",\n  b.member_churn_grade AS \"회원 중단위험 등급\",\n  b.sponsor_churn_grade AS \"후원건 이탈위험 등급\",\n  b.active_spnsr_cnt AS \"활동 약정 수(건)\",\n  d.act AS \"활동회원수(명)\",\n  d.pred AS \"회원 단위 예측 대상 회원수(명)\",\n  d.high AS \"중단 고위험 회원수(명)\"\nFROM base AS b\nCROSS JOIN denom AS d\nWHERE\n  b.member_churn_grade = '고위험'\nORDER BY\n  b.member_churn_prob DESC NULLS LAST\nLIMIT 10\n -- Generated by Cortex Analyst (request_id: 7abed7c8-3c53-4d75-95e4-fcca6f47b397)\n;\n```"
